# ===========================================================================
# RainingKeys -- ignore rules
#
# Repository root = this folder (E:\DSH Workspace\RainingKeys\RainingKeys)
# Rule of thumb: the mod's two sources and both CMake projects ship in git.
# Everything external (SDKs), generated (build output, packages), machine
# specific (the build/deploy scripts, which hard-code local paths) or authored
# elsewhere (dev notes, tooling) lives in the parent workspace folder and is not
# tracked.
# ===========================================================================

# --- Legacy BML port --------------------------------------------------------
# src/bml-old holds the legacy loader (.bmod) port and bml-old the CMake project
# that builds it. Both are tracked as of v0.1.1: the port is complete and
# verified, so there is no ignore block for them any more.
#
# Reminder: RainingKeys\src\bml-old\RainingKeys.cpp is GENERATED from
# src\RainingKeys.cpp by <workspace>\tools\make_bml_old_source.ps1 - never hand
# edit it, and regenerate (or run the script with -Check) after touching the
# BML+ source.

# --- Build output -----------------------------------------------------------
# The build trees themselves live outside the repository (<workspace>\build and
# <workspace>\build-bml-old), but anything created here by a manual cmake run is
# ignored too. Both artifacts (.bmodp = BML+, .bmod = legacy BML) are ignored:
# they are rebuilt from source and shipped through <workspace>\release.
build/
build-bml-old/
out/
cmake-build-*/
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
*.bmodp
*.bmod
*.dll
*.lib
*.exp
*.obj
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.idb
*.res
*.manifest

# --- External dependencies (downloaded separately, see README) --------------
deps/
*SDK*/

# --- Release packages -------------------------------------------------------
dist/
release/
_backup/
*.zip

# --- Editor / IDE -----------------------------------------------------------
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
CMakeUserPresets.json
compile_commands.json

# --- Scratch / temporary ----------------------------------------------------
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
*.bak-*
*.old
*.old-zh
~$*
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- Batch scripts ----------------------------------------------------------
# Not tracked on purpose: the build/deploy scripts hard-code this machine's SDK
# and game paths, so they are local tooling rather than repository content. The
# build steps themselves are documented in README.md / CHANGELOG.md.
*.bat
bml-old/*.bat
